{"seq":3,"slug":"aggregate-window-functions","title":"聚合窗口函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery/aggregate-window-functions","wordCount":803,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"聚合窗口函数\">聚合窗口函数</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>聚合与窗口是 SQL 分析能力的两条主线，区别在<strong>是否减少行数</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>聚合函数</strong>把一组行压缩为一行，配合 <code>GROUP BY</code> 分组、<code>HAVING</code> 过滤组</li>\n<li><strong>窗口函数</strong>在保留每一行的同时，对一组相关行计算并新增计算列，不合并行</li>\n</ul>\n<p>窗口函数由三部分构成：<code>PARTITION BY</code> 划分子集、<code>ORDER BY</code> 定义窗口内顺序、<code>ROWS/RANGE</code> 定义窗口框架。按用途可分为排名函数（ROW_NUMBER / RANK / DENSE_RANK）、偏移函数（LAG / LEAD / FIRST_VALUE / LAST_VALUE）与聚合窗口函数（SUM / AVG / COUNT 配合 <code>OVER</code>）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"聚合查询基础\">聚合查询基础</h2><p>聚合函数对一组行进行计算并返回单个值。配合 GROUP BY 和 HAVING，可以实现灵活的分组统计。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>聚合函数</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>COUNT(*)</td>\n<td>统计行数</td>\n<td>订单总数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SUM(col)</td>\n<td>求和</td>\n<td>销售总额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AVG(col)</td>\n<td>平均值</td>\n<td>平均客单价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAX(col)</td>\n<td>最大值</td>\n<td>最高工资</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MIN(col)</td>\n<td>最小值</td>\n<td>最早注册时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>COUNT(DISTINCT col)</td>\n<td>去重计数</td>\n<td>独立客户数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    dept_id,&#10;    COUNT(*)        AS emp_count,&#10;    AVG(salary)     AS avg_salary,&#10;    MAX(salary)     AS max_salary&#10;FROM employee&#10;GROUP BY dept_id&#10;HAVING COUNT(*) &gt;= 5&#10;ORDER BY avg_salary DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dept_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> emp_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(salary)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_salary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(salary)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_salary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"group-by-注意事项\">GROUP BY 注意事项</h3><ol>\n<li>SELECT 中非聚合列必须出现在 GROUP BY 中（SQL 标准要求）</li>\n<li>WHERE 在分组前过滤，HAVING 在分组后过滤</li>\n<li>GROUP BY 可以按多列分组，也可以使用表达式</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按年月统计销售额&#10;SELECT&#10;    YEAR(order_date)  AS order_year,&#10;    MONTH(order_date) AS order_month,&#10;    SUM(amount)       AS total_amount&#10;FROM orders&#10;GROUP BY YEAR(order_date), MONTH(order_date)&#10;ORDER BY order_year, order_month;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按年月统计销售额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    YEAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_date)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_year,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    MONTH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_month,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount)       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> YEAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_date), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MONTH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_year, order_month;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"窗口函数概述\">窗口函数概述</h2><p>窗口函数（Window Function）在保留每一行数据的同时，对一组相关行进行计算。与聚合函数不同，窗口函数不会将多行合并为一行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[原始数据] --&gt; B[GROUP BY 聚合]&#10;    A --&gt; C[窗口函数]&#10;    B --&gt; D[行数减少]&#10;    C --&gt; E[行数不变,新增计算列]\">graph LR\n    A[原始数据] --&gt; B[GROUP BY 聚合]\n    A --&gt; C[窗口函数]\n    B --&gt; D[行数减少]\n    C --&gt; E[行数不变,新增计算列]</pre><h3 id=\"窗口函数语法\">窗口函数语法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"函数名(参数) OVER (&#10;    [PARTITION BY 分区列]&#10;    [ORDER BY 排序列]&#10;    [ROWS/RANGE 窗口框架]&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">函数名(参数) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [PARTITION BY 分区列]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [ORDER BY 排序列]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [ROWS/RANGE 窗口框架]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子句</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PARTITION BY</td>\n<td>将数据划分为独立的窗口分区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ORDER BY</td>\n<td>定义窗口内行的排列顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ROWS/RANGE</td>\n<td>定义窗口框架的上下界</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"排名函数\">排名函数</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>并列处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ROW_NUMBER()</td>\n<td>连续编号，无并列</td>\n<td>1, 2, 3, 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RANK()</td>\n<td>有并列，跳过后续编号</td>\n<td>1, 2, 2, 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DENSE_RANK()</td>\n<td>有并列，不跳过编号</td>\n<td>1, 2, 2, 3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NTILE(n)</td>\n<td>将行均匀分为 n 组</td>\n<td>组号 1~n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    name,&#10;    dept_id,&#10;    salary,&#10;    ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY dept_id ORDER BY salary DESC) AS row_num,&#10;    RANK()       OVER (PARTITION BY dept_id ORDER BY salary DESC) AS rank_num,&#10;    DENSE_RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY dept_id ORDER BY salary DESC) AS dense_num&#10;FROM employee;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dept_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    salary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ROW_NUMBER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> row_num,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    RANK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rank_num,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    DENSE_RANK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dense_num</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"典型应用-取每组-top-n\">典型应用：取每组 Top-N</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH ranked AS (&#10;    SELECT&#10;        name, dept_id, salary,&#10;        ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY dept_id ORDER BY salary DESC) AS rn&#10;    FROM employee&#10;)&#10;SELECT name, dept_id, salary&#10;FROM ranked&#10;WHERE rn &lt;= 3;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dept_id, salary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        ROW_NUMBER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dept_id, salary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ranked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"偏移函数\">偏移函数</h2><p>偏移函数用于访问当前行的前后行数据，常用于环比、同比计算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LAG(col, n, default)</td>\n<td>向前取第 n 行的值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LEAD(col, n, default)</td>\n<td>向后取第 n 行的值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FIRST_VALUE(col)</td>\n<td>窗口内第一行的值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LAST_VALUE(col)</td>\n<td>窗口内最后一行的值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    order_month,&#10;    total_amount,&#10;    LAG(total_amount, 1)  OVER (ORDER BY order_month) AS prev_month,&#10;    total_amount - LAG(total_amount, 1) OVER (ORDER BY order_month) AS month_diff&#10;FROM monthly_sales;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_month,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    LAG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total_amount, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_month) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev_month,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LAG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(total_amount, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_month) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> month_diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> monthly_sales;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"聚合窗口函数\">聚合窗口函数</h2><p>标准聚合函数（SUM、AVG、COUNT 等）也可以作为窗口函数使用，实现累计计算和移动平均。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    order_date,&#10;    amount,&#10;    SUM(amount) OVER (ORDER BY order_date) AS running_total,&#10;    AVG(amount) OVER (ORDER BY order_date ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW) AS moving_avg_7d,&#10;    COUNT(*)    OVER (PARTITION BY customer_id) AS customer_order_count&#10;FROM orders;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> running_total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROWS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> moving_avg_7d,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_order_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"窗口框架\">窗口框架</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架定义</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW</td>\n<td>从分区起始到当前行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ROWS BETWEEN 3 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW</td>\n<td>当前行及前 3 行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ROWS BETWEEN 1 PRECEDING AND 1 FOLLOWING</td>\n<td>前一行、当前行、后一行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ROWS BETWEEN CURRENT ROW AND UNBOUNDED FOLLOWING</td>\n<td>当前行到分区末尾</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 累计销售额与 7 日移动平均&#10;SELECT&#10;    sale_date,&#10;    daily_amount,&#10;    SUM(daily_amount) OVER (&#10;        ORDER BY sale_date&#10;        ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW&#10;    ) AS cumulative_total,&#10;    AVG(daily_amount) OVER (&#10;        ORDER BY sale_date&#10;        ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW&#10;    ) AS avg_7day&#10;FROM daily_sales;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 累计销售额与 7 日移动平均</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sale_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    daily_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(daily_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sale_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ROWS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNBOUNDED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cumulative_total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(daily_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sale_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ROWS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_7day</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_sales;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"实战综合示例\">实战综合示例</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 综合报表：部门维度的员工排名、占比、累计&#10;SELECT&#10;    dept_id,&#10;    name,&#10;    salary,&#10;    RANK() OVER (PARTITION BY dept_id ORDER BY salary DESC) AS dept_rank,&#10;    ROUND(salary / SUM(salary) OVER (PARTITION BY dept_id) * 100, 2) AS salary_pct,&#10;    SUM(salary) OVER (&#10;        PARTITION BY dept_id ORDER BY salary DESC&#10;        ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW&#10;    ) AS dept_cumulative&#10;FROM employee&#10;ORDER BY dept_id, dept_rank;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 综合报表：部门维度的员工排名、占比、累计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dept_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    salary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    RANK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_rank,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(salary) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salary_pct,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(salary) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ROWS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNBOUNDED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_cumulative</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id, dept_rank;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>GROUP BY + HAVING</strong> 是聚合分析的基础，WHERE 过滤行，HAVING 过滤组</li>\n<li><strong>窗口函数</strong>不减少行数，在保留明细的同时提供排名、累计、偏移等计算能力</li>\n<li><strong>ROW_NUMBER / RANK / DENSE_RANK</strong> 解决排名和 Top-N 问题</li>\n<li><strong>LAG / LEAD</strong> 实现环比、同比等前后行比较</li>\n<li><strong>SUM/AVG OVER</strong> 配合窗口框架实现累计和移动平均</li>\n<li>窗口函数是现代 SQL 分析的核心能力，所有主流数据库均已支持</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"聚合窗口函数","id":"聚合窗口函数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合查询基础","id":"聚合查询基础"},{"level":3,"text":"GROUP BY 注意事项","id":"group-by-注意事项"},{"level":2,"text":"窗口函数概述","id":"窗口函数概述"},{"level":3,"text":"窗口函数语法","id":"窗口函数语法"},{"level":2,"text":"排名函数","id":"排名函数"},{"level":3,"text":"典型应用：取每组 Top-N","id":"典型应用-取每组-top-n"},{"level":2,"text":"偏移函数","id":"偏移函数"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合窗口函数","id":"聚合窗口函数"},{"level":3,"text":"窗口框架","id":"窗口框架"},{"level":2,"text":"实战综合示例","id":"实战综合示例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"复杂查询与子查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery/complex-queries"},"next":{"title":"存储过程与函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery/stored-procedures"}}